<title>THAILAND: Serm Suk Q3 unconsol net falls 19 pct. [CORRECTED 03:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Serm Suk Q3 unconsol net falls 19 pct. [CORRECTED 03:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects to change company name from Siam Cement Plc to Serm Suk Plc.)</p>
<p>Unconsolidated financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.46     vs	   5.52</p>
<p>    Net profit	     115.89     vs	 143.46</p>
<p>				  Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		20.44     vs	   22.00</p>
<p>    Net profit	     531.35     vs	  571.91</p>
<p>NOTES:  Revs not stated. Company's full name is the Serm Suk Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
